        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7v10" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>

      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kavkazgoldblack/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="ig-cta" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="1.1" fill="#C9A84C"/></svg>
        <span>Voir les témoignages sur <strong>@kavkazgoldblack</strong></span>
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7v10" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
      <div class="pdp-reviews__grid">
        <div class="pdp-rv">
          <div class="pdp-rv__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="pdp-rv__text">"Depuis que je laisse agir 15-20min je n'ai plus de pellicules ! Ça mousse super bien, ça sent bon. J'ai commandé 3 mois, j'attends les autres mois pour te faire un retour en photo."</p>
