        <div class="pdp-rv">
          <div class="pdp-rv__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="pdp-rv__text">"Après presque un mois : disparition totale des pellicules, cheveux plus beaux, plus sains et légèrement plus foncés. Je continue la cure 3 mois mais je suis déjà très content."</p>
          <span class="pdp-rv__author">Amine K. · Paris</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pdp-rv">
          <div class="pdp-rv__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="pdp-rv__text">"J'étais sceptique parce que je suis blond mais ça marche très bien. Meilleure couleur, moins de démangeaisons, gain en volume. Meilleure alternative aux shampoings que j'ai testés."</p>
          <span class="pdp-rv__author">Thomas L. · Bordeaux</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pdp-rv">
          <div class="pdp-rv__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="pdp-rv__text">"MashaAllah le produit fonctionne très bien, je compte l'utiliser tous les jours. T'as une mine d'or entre les mains."</p>
          <span class="pdp-rv__author">Youssef M. · Lyon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pdp-rv">
          <div class="pdp-rv__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="pdp-rv__text">"Mes cheveux sont moins gras, j'ai moins de démangeaisons. J'ai l'impression que j'ai plus de volume et d'épaisseur — je vois moins mon crâne. Ça fait que 2 semaines et je suis très content. Je pense que le fait d'arrêter les shampoings industriels aide beaucoup aussi."</p>
          <span class="pdp-rv__author">Fabien R. · France</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>

  <!-- Barre fixe mobile -->
  {%- if product.available -%}
    <div class="stickybar" id="bottom-bar">
      <div class="stickybar__info">
        <div class="stickybar__name">Kavkaz Gold Black</div>
        <div class="stickybar__price g" id="bb-price">{{ product.price | money }}</div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-gold stickybar__btn" onclick="document.getElementById('product-form').querySelector('[name=add]').click()">
        Ajouter au panier
      </button>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

</div>

<style>
.upsell-wrap{margin:24px 0}
.upsell-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .2s;background:var(--surface)}
.upsell-card:has(#brush-cb:checked){border-color:var(--gold)}
.upsell-card__img{width:64px;height:64px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;flex-shrink:0}
.upsell-card__body{flex:1;min-width:0}
.upsell-card__tag{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:4px;font-family:var(--mono)}
.upsell-card__name{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:3px}
.upsell-card__sub{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.upsell-card__right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0}
.upsell-card__price{font-size:15px;font-weight:700}
.upsell-card__box{width:20px;height:20px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all .2s}
.upsell-card:has(#brush-cb:checked) .upsell-card__box{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}
.upsell-card:has(#brush-cb:checked) .upsell-card__box::after{content:'';width:10px;height:6px;border-left:2px solid #000;border-bottom:2px solid #000;transform:rotate(-45deg) translateY(-2px);display:block}
.guarantee-bar{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;background:rgba(201,168,76,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.25);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--fg)}
.guarantee-bar svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}
.guarantee-bar__note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}
.guarantee-bar__note strong{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
.first-order-badge{background:rgba(201,168,76,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:14px}
.first-order-badge strong{color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.5px}
.gift-widget{background:rgba(201,168,76,0.08);border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin:14px 0 4px}
.gift-widget__label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}
.gift-widget__row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.gift-widget__item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1;min-width:0}
.gift-widget__item img{width:56px;height:56px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;flex-shrink:0}
.gift-widget__name{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--fg)}
.gift-widget__name em{font-style:normal;color:#999;font-size:11.5px}
.gift-widget__name b{color:var(--gold)}
.gift-widget__name s{opacity:.6}
.gift-widget__plus{font-size:20px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}
.gift-widget--link{display:block;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s}
.gift-widget--link:hover{background:rgba(201,168,76,0.16)}
.gift-widget__cta{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
@media (max-width:480px){.gift-widget__row{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.gift-widget__plus{margin-left:23px}}
.vcard__gift{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--gold);margin-top:3px;font-weight:600}
.pdp__list{list-style:none;margin:0 0 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.pdp__list li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--fg);padding-left:18px;position:relative}
.pdp__list li::before{content:'•';color:var(--gold);position:absolute;left:0;top:0}
.pdp__desc--calendar{background:rgba(201,168,76,0.07);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding:14px 16px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;margin-bottom:10px}
.pdp__cal__title{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-family:var(--mono);margin-bottom:10px}
.pdp__cal__grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.pdp__cal__row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}
.pdp__cal__when{font-size:11px;font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--gold);white-space:nowrap;min-width:54px;flex-shrink:0}
.pdp__cal__what{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--cream);line-height:1.4}
.pdp__desc--warning{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:12px;margin-top:4px}
.tp-badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(0,182,122,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(0,182,122,0.3);border-radius:8px;padding:11px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--fg);text-decoration:none}
.tp-badge strong{color:#00B67A}
.pdp__results{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:14px}
.pdp__results span{font-size:12px;font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--gold);background:rgba(201,168,76,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.22);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 11px;white-space:nowrap}
.pdp-reviews{margin-top:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:32px}
.pdp-reviews__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
@media(max-width:600px){.pdp-reviews__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.pdp-rv{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:16px}
.pdp-rv__stars{color:var(--gold);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:1px}
.pdp-rv__text{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--fg);margin:0 0 10px}
.pdp-rv__author{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.5px;font-family:var(--mono)}
</style>

<script>
function kgbSel(radio) {
  document.getElementById('pf-blurb').textContent = radio.dataset.blurb;
  document.getElementById('pf-compare').style.display = 'none';
  document.querySelectorAll('.vcard').forEach(function(c){ c.classList.remove('vcard--on'); });
  radio.closest('.vcard').classList.add('vcard--on');
  var isPack = radio.dataset.isPack === 'true';
  var eyebrow = document.getElementById('pdp-eyebrow');
  var title = document.getElementById('pdp-title');
  if (eyebrow) eyebrow.textContent = isPack ? 'Cure capillaire 3 mois' : 'Savon noir capillaire';
  if (title) title.textContent = isPack ? 'Protocole Kavkaz Gold Black — Cure Capillaire Complète 3 Mois' : 'Kavkaz Gold Black';
  var gwPack = document.getElementById('gw-pack');
  var gwSolo = document.getElementById('gw-solo');
  if (gwPack) gwPack.style.display = isPack ? '' : 'none';
  if (gwSolo) gwSolo.style.display = isPack ? 'none' : '';
  var upsell = document.querySelector('.upsell-wrap');
  var brushCb = document.getElementById('brush-cb');
  if (upsell) upsell.style.display = isPack ? 'none' : '';
  if (isPack && brushCb) brushCb.checked = false;
  kgbUpd();
}

function kgbUpd() {
  var radio = document.querySelector('input[name="id"]:checked');
  if (!radio) return;
  var cents = parseInt(radio.dataset.cents, 10);
  var qty = Math.max(1, parseInt(document.getElementById('qin').value, 10) || 1);
  var total = cents * qty;
  var brushCb = document.getElementById('brush-cb');
  var brushCard = document.querySelector('.upsell-card[data-cents]');
  if (brushCb && brushCb.checked && brushCard) {
    total += parseInt(brushCard.dataset.cents, 10);
  }
  var fmt = (total / 100).toFixed(2).replace('.', ',') + ' €';
  document.getElementById('pf-price').textContent = fmt;
  var bb = document.getElementById('bb-price');
  if (bb) bb.textContent = fmt;
  var img = document.getElementById('pf-img');
  if (img && radio.dataset.img) img.src = radio.dataset.img;
}

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  kgbUpd();
  var form = document.getElementById('product-form');
  if (!form) return;
  form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
    var brushCb = document.getElementById('brush-cb');
    var brushCard = document.querySelector('.upsell-card[data-vid]');
    if (!brushCb || !brushCb.checked || !brushCard) return;
    e.preventDefault();
    var mainRadio = document.querySelector('input[name="id"]:checked') || document.querySelector('input[name="id"]');
    if (!mainRadio) return;
    var mainVid = parseInt(mainRadio.value);
    var qty = Math.max(1, parseInt(document.getElementById('qin').value) || 1);
    var brushVid = parseInt(brushCard.dataset.vid);
    var btn = document.getElementById('main-atc');
    btn.disabled = true;
    btn.textContent = 'Ajout en cours…';
    fetch('/cart/add.js', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ items: [
        { id: mainVid, quantity: qty },
        { id: brushVid, quantity: 1 }
      ]})
    }).then(function() {
      window.location.href = '/cart';
    }).catch(function() {
      btn.disabled = false;
      btn.textContent = 'Ajouter au panier';
    });
  });
});
</script>

